# ── Procta paused: maintenance-mode Caddyfile ──────────────────────
# Replaces the full application routing (backed up alongside this file
# as Caddyfile.pre-pause-backup-<date> on the server) with a single
# static holding page served for every path on app.procta.net. No
# proxying to the api/dashboard containers happens from here - they
# keep running underneath (untouched), this just stops routing public
# traffic to them.
